VERDICT. Against the only class matching the observed words' shape, six
of ten is half a standard error from nothing and is beaten by chance in
44% of draws. THE RATIO IS NOT EVIDENCE AND MUST NOT BE QUOTED AS SUCH.
It is also not disproof: the test is simply uninformative, which is the
point -- an uninformative statistic presented as support is 1.7's shape.
